Place + で + action expresses at a place (action). Identify the role of each phrase, then apply the formation rule in context."},{"id":"n5-17-formation","prompt":"Choose the correct formation for “Action location で”.","options":["Subject + が + predicate","Object + を + verb","Place + で + action verb","Topic + は + comment"],"answer":"Place + で + action verb","explanation":"Place + で + action expresses at a place (action). Identify the role of each phrase, then apply the formation rule in context."},{"id":"n5-17-example","prompt":"Which sentence illustrates “Action location で”?","options":["水を飲みます。","図書館で勉強します。","今日は暑いです。","猫がいます。"],"answer":"図書館で勉強します。","explanation":"図書館で勉強します。 (Toshokan de benkyou shimasu.) means “I study at the library.”."},{"id":"n5-17-translation","prompt":"Choose the meaning of: 図書館で勉強します。","options":["I study at the library.","It is hot today.","There is a cat.","I drink water."],"answer":"I study at the library.","explanation":"図書館で勉強します。 (Toshokan de benkyou shimasu.) means “I study at the library.”."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":18,"category":"Particles","title":"Tool / method で","pattern":"Tool + で + action","meaning":"By means of / using","explanation":"Tool + で + action expresses by means of / using. Identify the role of each phrase, then apply the formation rule in context.","formation":"Tool / method + で + verb","difficulty":"Beginner","examples":[{"japanese":"はしで食べます。","romaji":"Hashi de tabemasu.","meaning":"I eat with chopsticks."}],"common_mistakes":["Use the exact construction Tool / method + で + verb; do not replace it with a similar-looking pattern."],"practice_questions":[{"id":"n5-18-meaning","prompt":"What does “Tool + で + action” mean?","options":["Subject / newly identified information","Direct object","By means of / using","Topic of the sentence"],"answer":"By means of / using","explanation":"Tool + で + action expresses by means of / using. Identify the role of each phrase, then apply the formation rule in context."},{