-example","prompt":"Which sentence illustrates “Dislike 嫌いです”?","options":["田中さんは歌が上手です。","私はダンスが下手です。","私は納豆が嫌いです。","私は日本語が好きです。"],"answer":"私は納豆が嫌いです。","explanation":"私は納豆が嫌いです。 (Watashi wa nattou ga kirai desu.) means “I dislike natto.”."},{"id":"n5-68-translation","prompt":"Choose the meaning of: 私は納豆が嫌いです。","options":["I am bad at dancing.","I dislike natto.","I like Japanese.","Tanaka is good at singing."],"answer":"I dislike natto.","explanation":"私は納豆が嫌いです。 (Watashi wa nattou ga kirai desu.) means “I dislike natto.”."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":69,"category":"Preferences","title":"Good at 上手です","pattern":"Noun + が + 上手です","meaning":"Good at","explanation":"Noun + が + 上手です expresses good at. Identify the role of each phrase, then apply the formation rule in context.","formation":"Person は + activity が + 上手です","difficulty":"Core","examples":[{"japanese":"田中さんは歌が上手です。","romaji":"Tanaka-san wa uta ga jouzu desu.","meaning":"Tanaka is good at singing."}],"common_mistakes":["Use the exact construction Person は + activity が + 上手です; do not replace it with a similar-looking pattern."],"practice_questions":[{"id":"n5-69-meaning","prompt":"What does “Noun + が + 上手です” mean?","options":["Like","Dislike","Bad at","Good at"],"answer":"Good at","explanation":"Noun + が + 上手です expresses good at. Identify the role of each phrase, then apply the formation rule in context."},{"id":"n5-69-formation","prompt":"Choose the correct formation for “Good at 上手です”.","options":["Person は + thing が + 嫌いです","Person は + activity が + 下手です","Person は + activity が + 上手です","Person は + thing が + 好きです"],"answer":"Person は + activity が + 上手です","explanation":"Noun + が + 上手です expresses good at. Identify the role of each phrase, then apply the formation rule in context."},{"id":"n5-69-example","prompt":"Which sentence illustrates “Good at 上手です”?","options":["私はダンスが下手です。","田中さんは歌が上手です。","私は日本語が好きです。","私は納豆が嫌いです。"],"answer":"田中さんは歌が上手です。","explanation":"田中さんは歌が上手です。 (Tanaka-san wa uta ga jouzu d