","The cat is under the chair.","I am a student.","I am not a doctor."],"answer":"The cat is under the chair.","explanation":"猫は椅子の下にいます。 (Neko wa isu no shita ni imasu.) means “The cat is under the chair.”."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N5","sort_order":77,"category":"Time","title":"Before まえに","pattern":"Verb dictionary + まえに","meaning":"Before doing","explanation":"Verb dictionary + まえに expresses before doing. Identify the role of each phrase, then apply the formation rule in context.","formation":"Verb dictionary + まえに","difficulty":"Core","examples":[{"japanese":"寝るまえに本を読みます。","romaji":"Neru mae ni hon o yomimasu.","meaning":"I read before sleeping."}],"common_mistakes":["Use the exact construction Verb dictionary + まえに; do not replace it with a similar-looking pattern."],"practice_questions":[{"id":"n5-77-meaning","prompt":"What does “Verb dictionary + まえに” mean?","options":["After doing","When / at the time","Around a time","Before doing"],"answer":"Before doing","explanation":"Verb dictionary + まえに expresses before doing. Identify the role of each phrase, then apply the formation rule in context."},{"id":"n5-77-formation","prompt":"Choose the correct formation for “Before まえに”.","options":["Plain form + とき","Clock time + ごろ","Verb dictionary + まえに","Verb た-form + あとで"],"answer":"Verb dictionary + まえに","explanation":"Verb dictionary + まえに expresses before doing. Identify the role of each phrase, then apply the formation rule in context."},{"id":"n5-77-example","prompt":"Which sentence illustrates “Before まえに”?","options":["七時ごろ帰ります。","寝るまえに本を読みます。","宿題をしたあとでテレビを見ます。","日本へ行くときカメラを買います。"],"answer":"寝るまえに本を読みます。","explanation":"寝るまえに本を読みます。 (Neru mae ni hon o yomimasu.) means “I read before sleeping.”."},{"id":"n5-77-translation","prompt":"Choose the meaning of: 寝るまえに本を読みます。","options":["I read before sleeping.","I watch TV after doing homework.","When I go to Japan, I will buy a camera.","I will return around seven."],"answer":"I read before sleeping.","explanation":"寝るまえ